chock runs other programs rather than reimplementing them. It does not bundle,
link or redistribute any of them — each is installed separately and pinned by
version in tool-versions.env. Their licences are their own; check them before
redistributing anything that includes them.

Tools chock invokes:

  just                https://github.com/casey/just
  cargo-nextest       https://github.com/nextest-rs/nextest
  cargo-llvm-cov      https://github.com/taiki-e/cargo-llvm-cov
  cargo-crap          https://github.com/minikin/cargo-crap
  cargo-deny          https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-deny
  cargo-machete       https://github.com/bnjbvr/cargo-machete
  cargo-udeps         https://github.com/est31/cargo-udeps
  cargo-mutants       https://github.com/sourcefrog/cargo-mutants
  cargo-bsize         https://crates.io/crates/cargo-bsize
  typos               https://github.com/crate-ci/typos
  kani                https://github.com/model-checking/kani

  mutest-rs           https://github.com/outpostHQ/mutest-rs
